name: Glass Card — X2 mult, fragile
author: corpus
description: >-
  Glass Card gives X2 Mult when scored, but has a 1 in 4 chance to be destroyed. First-shop
  card engine: pair with Glass Joker, Seltzer, and Dusk for repeated destruction/scaling.
deck: Red
stake: White
must:
  - standardCard:
      enhancement: Glass
      antes: [1]
      sources:
        shopItems: [0, 1, 2, 3]
        boosterPacks: [0, 1]
should:
  - joker: GlassJoker
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 45
  - joker: Seltzer
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 40
  - joker: Dusk
    antes: [1, 2, 3]
    score: 35
